===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Very [[busy]].
#: ''I was so '''rushed''' today, I didn't have time to eat lunch.''
# Done in [[haste]]; done quickly or hastily.
#: ''My '''rushed''' attempt at an essay received a predictably poor grade.''
# Abounding or covered with [[rush]]es.

